     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The range is the difference between the maximum and the minimum values.</p>\n<p>The maximum is 10.</p>\n<p>The minimum is 1.</p>\n<p>The range is 10 − 1 = 9.</p>"
    },
